<title>JAPAN: Kosei Sec to buy back 9.4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Kosei Sec to buy back 9.4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kosei Securities Co Ltd said on Friday it would buy back up to 9.4 million of its shares and change its company regulations to carry out the repurchase swiftly.  </p>
<p>The decision needs to be approved at a shareholders' meeting on June 27.</p>
</text>
